  "title": "The Amazing Octopus",
  "source": "original",
  "text": "The octopus is one of the most fascinating creatures in the ocean. It has eight flexible arms covered with hundreds of suction cups. An octopus can squeeze its soft body through incredibly narrow openings to escape predators. Scientists have discovered that octopuses are remarkably intelligent, able to solve puzzles and even open jars to find food. Some octopuses can change their color and texture in an instant, blending perfectly into their surroundings.",
